// never part of generated source: while prerendering, each URL carries the
// placeholder `SITE_ORIGIN_TOKEN` that the build replaces with its
// `CRUFTFREE_SITE_ORIGIN` input (and `SITE_ROBOTS_TOKEN` with the policy its
// `CRUFTFREE_SITE_INDEXABLE` input chooses); in the browser the origin is the page's own.
// A canonical address the page names (`canonical: configured(name)`) is the
// profile's address of that name (`CONFIGURED_LINKS`), a build input as well.
//
